        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayasuka ati, “Naliba uwapimpa mukubombela Yawe, Lesa umwine wa fita. Abena Israeli balikaana icipangano cobe, balitobaula ne fibumbili fya malambo fyobe, no kwipaya bakasesema bobe bonse ku lupanga. Ninefye neka nshele, elyo kabili na ine wine balefwaya ukunjipaya.”",
          "type": "text",
